<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
<!--
★ v0.4 — UX 设计单页 HTML 模板（精简版）
Generated by /ux-project:onepage alongside ux-onepage.md
Self-contained: inline CSS, Mermaid via CDN. Print-friendly.

设计原则（rule 22）：
- 这是给 stakeholder 看的版本，不是 audit trail。引用 / 阶段时间戳 / 流程标签全部不显示。
- 完整 cite 留在 ux-onepage.md 里。HTML 只是清爽展示。
- 每段语言尽量短：能 12 个字别用 20 个字。

Placeholders to fill:
  {{PROJECT_NAME}}                  e.g., "alternate-routing"
  {{GOAL_STATEMENT}}                一句话目标（短）
  {{PROBLEM_FRAMING}}               1–2 句话现状+真正要解决的事（短）
  {{PRIMARY_USER}}                  短标签
  {{SECONDARY_USERS}}               逗号分隔短标签
  {{BASELINE_BULLETS_HTML}}         <li>content</li> 系列（不带 sup ref）
  {{SCENARIO_ROWS_HTML}}            <tr>...</tr> 系列（无 ref 列）
  {{NOT_DOING_BULLETS_HTML}}        <li><b>S<n>:name</b> — reason</li> 系列
  {{JTBD_CARDS_HTML}}               <div class="jtbd-card">...</div> 系列
  {{IA_TREE_HTML}}                  嵌套 <ul><li>name <span class="purpose">— purpose</span></li></ul>
  {{IA_COVERAGE_HTML}}              <li>需求 N → 路径</li> 系列
  {{MERMAID_FLOW_SRC}}              raw mermaid source（preserve indentation）
  {{FLOW_COVERAGE_HTML}}            <li>需求 N → 路径</li> 系列
  {{CONSTRAINTS_BULLETS_HTML}}      <li>...</li> 系列（短）
  {{ASSUMPTIONS_BULLETS_HTML}}      <li>...</li> 系列（短）
  {{OPEN_QUESTIONS_HTML}}           <li>...</li> 系列（短）

NOT included anymore (intentionally removed from stakeholder view):
- header meta (PRD version / date / regen count)
- phase strip (background-cleared / requirements-converged / structure-ready badges)
- section sub-tag (phase-tag spans inside h2)
- section lede paragraphs (h2 should speak for itself)
- citation footnotes section
- <sup class="ref"> markers in body
-->
<title>UX 设计单页 — {{PROJECT_NAME}}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #111;
    --ink-soft: #444;
    --line: #1a1a1a;
    --line-soft: #d4d4d4;
    --paper: #fafaf7;
    --paper-card: #ffffff;
    --paper-accent: #f0efea;
    --keep: #0e7a3f;
    --cut: #8a8a8a;
    --tag: #2b2b2b;
    --tag-bg: #ececec;
    --warn-bg: #fff4d6;
    --warn-border: #d4a017;
    --font: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    --mono: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--font); }
  body { line-height: 1.55; font-size: 14px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  .page { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 36px 72px; }

  /* Header — minimal: just the title */
  .doc-header { padding-bottom: 14px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line); }
  .doc-header h1 { font-size: 26px; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }

  /* Section */
  section { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  section > h2 { font-size: 17px; margin: 0 0 12px; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft); }

  /* Goal block */
  .goal-block { background: var(--paper-card); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-left: 4px solid var(--line); padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .goal-block .statement { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; }
  .goal-block .framing { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .user-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 12px; }
  .user-chip { padding: 3px 9px; background: var(--paper-accent); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: 4px; }
  .user-chip.primary { border-color: var(--line); font-weight: 600; }

  /* Baseline */
  .baseline-list { padding-left: 20px; margin: 0; font-size: 13px; }
  .baseline-list li { margin-bottom: 5px; }

  /* Scenario table */
  table.scenario-map { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; background: var(--paper-card); }
  table.scenario-map th, table.scenario-map td { border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); padding: 7px 10px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  table.scenario-map th { background: var(--paper-accent); font-weight: 600; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  table.scenario-map td.decision-keep { color: var(--keep); font-weight: 600; }
  table.scenario-map td.decision-cut { color: var(--cut); text-decoration: line-through; }
  table.scenario-map .lens-tag { font-size: 10px; padding: 2px 6px; background: var(--tag-bg); border-radius: 3px; color: var(--tag); white-space: nowrap; }

  /* Not Doing */
  .not-doing { background: var(--paper-card); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .not-doing ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; }
  .not-doing li { margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .not-doing li b { color: var(--ink); }

  /* JTBD cards */
  .jtbd-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .jtbd-card { background: var(--paper-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 12px 14px; }
  .jtbd-card .id { font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-soft); letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .jtbd-card .text { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .jtbd-card .text b { font-weight: 600; }
  .jtbd-card .priority { display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; padding: 2px 6px; margin-top: 8px; background: var(--paper-accent); border-radius: 3px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .jtbd-card.anti { background: var(--paper-accent); border-style: dashed; }
  .jtbd-card.anti .id { color: var(--cut); }

  /* IA tree */
  .ia-tree-wrap { background: var(--paper-card); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); padding: 16px 22px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .ia-tree-wrap ul { list-style: none; padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; border-left: 1px dashed var(--line-soft); }
  .ia-tree-wrap > ul { border-left: none; padding-left: 0; }
  .ia-tree-wrap li { position: relative; padding: 2px 0 2px 14px; }
  .ia-tree-wrap li::before { content: "└─"; position: absolute; left: -4px; top: 2px; color: var(--line-soft); }
  .ia-tree-wrap > ul > li::before { content: "■"; color: var(--ink); font-size: 9px; top: 6px; left: -2px; }
  .ia-tree-wrap .purpose { color: var(--ink-soft); font-style: italic; }
  .ia-coverage { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 12px; }
  .ia-coverage h4 { margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-soft); letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-weight: 600; }
  .ia-coverage ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
  .ia-coverage li { margin-bottom: 2px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; }

  /* Flow */
  .mermaid-wrap { background: var(--paper-card); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); padding: 18px; border-radius: 4px; overflow-x: auto; }
  .mermaid { background: transparent !important; }
  .flow-coverage { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 12px; }
  .flow-coverage h4 { margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-soft); letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-weight: 600; }
  .flow-coverage ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
  .flow-coverage li { margin-bottom: 2px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; }

  /* Supporting context */
  .supporting { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; }
  .supporting .col h3 { font-size: 12px; margin: 0 0 6px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 600; }
  .supporting ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; font-size: 12px; }
  .supporting li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .supporting .open-q li { color: var(--ink); }

  /* Stale banner */
  .stale-banner { background: var(--warn-bg); border: 1px solid var(--warn-border); padding: 9px 13px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 13px; }

  /* Print */
  @media print {
    .page { padding: 16px; }
    section { page-break-inside: avoid; }
    .jtbd-grid, .scenario-map, .ia-tree-wrap, .mermaid-wrap { page-break-inside: avoid; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <header class="doc-header">
    <h1>UX 设计单页 — {{PROJECT_NAME}}</h1>
    <!-- {{STALE_BANNER_HTML}} - 仅 stale 时插入 -->
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>我们要解决什么</h2>
    <div class="goal-block">
      <div class="statement">{{GOAL_STATEMENT}}</div>
      <div class="framing">{{PROBLEM_FRAMING}}</div>
      <div class="user-row">
        <span class="user-chip primary">主要用户：{{PRIMARY_USER}}</span>
        <span class="user-chip">还会影响：{{SECONDARY_USERS}}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>线上现状</h2>
    <ul class="baseline-list">
      {{BASELINE_BULLETS_HTML}}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>用户场景与取舍</h2>
    <table class="scenario-map">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>#</th>
          <th>场景</th>
          <th>视角</th>
          <th>价值</th>
          <th>成本</th>
          <th>核心度</th>
          <th>做不做</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{SCENARIO_ROWS_HTML}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>明确不做</h2>
    <div class="not-doing">
      <ul>
        {{NOT_DOING_BULLETS_HTML}}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>用户真正想完成的事</h2>
    <div class="jtbd-grid">
      {{JTBD_CARDS_HTML}}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>信息架构</h2>
    <div class="ia-tree-wrap">
      {{IA_TREE_HTML}}
    </div>
    <div class="ia-coverage">
      <h4>需求 → 位置</h4>
      <ul>
        {{IA_COVERAGE_HTML}}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>交互流程</h2>
    <div class="mermaid-wrap">
      <pre class="mermaid">
{{MERMAID_FLOW_SRC}}
      </pre>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-coverage">
      <h4>需求 → 路径</h4>
      <ul>
        {{FLOW_COVERAGE_HTML}}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>额外信息</h2>
    <div class="supporting">
      <div class="col">
        <h3>硬约束</h3>
        <ul>{{CONSTRAINTS_BULLETS_HTML}}</ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h3>当前假设</h3>
        <ul>{{ASSUMPTIONS_BULLETS_HTML}}</ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="supporting" style="margin-top: 16px;">
      <div class="col open-q">
        <h3>待回答</h3>
        <ul>{{OPEN_QUESTIONS_HTML}}</ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h3>下一步</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>高保真 UI / Figma：交给 <code>huashu-design</code> / <code>frontend-design</code> / Figma</li>
          <li>下游需考虑：默认 / 空 / 加载 / 成功 / 失败 / 无权限 / 边界</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mermaid@10/dist/mermaid.min.js"></script>
<script>
  if (window.mermaid) {
    mermaid.initialize({
      startOnLoad: true,
      theme: "neutral",
      themeVariables: {
        fontFamily: "ui-monospace, monospace",
        primaryColor: "#ffffff",
        primaryBorderColor: "#1a1a1a",
        primaryTextColor: "#111",
        lineColor: "#1a1a1a",
        secondaryColor: "#f0efea",
        tertiaryColor: "#fafaf7"
      },
      flowchart: { curve: "linear", padding: 12 }
    });
  }
</script>
</body>
</html>
